{"id":"e0c0a9b4cfad8f60","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation.md","title":"最外一步归约关系","display":"df-outermost-rewrite-relation — 最外一步归约关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation","aliases":["56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation"],"display":"df-outermost-rewrite-relation — 最外一步归约关系","depends_on":["[[56-df-outermost-redex-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]","[[56-df-replace]]","[[56-df-substitution]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]"],"source_section":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.5(iii–iv); §9.1 Definition 9.1.1","source_printed_pages":"131,478–479","source_ocr_blocks":[152,499,500],"source_verification":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-outermost-rewrite-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-outermost-rewrite-relation — 最外一步归约关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"246c089e11e34935\" href=\"?note=246c089e11e34935\" title=\"56-df-outermost-redex-position\">56-df-outermost-redex-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.5(iii–iv); §9.1 Definition 9.1.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"131,478–479"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span><span>499</span><span>500</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 与规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"246c089e11e34935\" href=\"?note=246c089e11e34935\" title=\"56-df-outermost-redex-position\">56-df-outermost-redex-position</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OuterPos}\">\\(\\operatorname{OuterPos}\\)</span> 也见该节点。</li>\n<li>子项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s|_p\">\\(s|_p\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>，位置替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[u]_p\">\\(s[u]_p\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\\sigma,r\\sigma\">\\(l\\sigma,r\\sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6228082765353868\" href=\"?note=6228082765353868\" title=\"56-df-substitution\">56-df-substitution</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{RedexPos}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}:=\n\\{(s,t)\\in T^2:\n\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R,s)\\,\n\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\,\\exists\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;\n(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}:=\n\\{(s,t)\\in T^2:\n\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{OuterPos}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R,s)\\,\n\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\,\\exists\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\;\n(s|_p=l\\sigma\\land t=s[r\\sigma]_p)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}t\n\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n(s,t)\\in\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}t\n\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n(s,t)\\in\\to_{\\operatorname{out},\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是允许所有最外收缩的端点关系，可能非确定；它区别于既有NO函数所作的最左选择。定义显式保留位置和规则的存在见证，但关系本身不保留步身份，所以不能用端点序列恢复公平性、残余或投影。这里只用它刻画合法最外选择及正规形；关于公平的节点须使用另外的有标签步接口。</p>\n<p>来源的OCR页块序号按本地提取文本中的分页符编号，不等同于DjVu物理页码。本轮未作机器证明；计算性未编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-outermost-redex-position","status":"resolved","id":"246c089e11e34935","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-outermost-redex-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-replace]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6228082765353868","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-outermost-redex-position","status":"resolved","id":"246c089e11e34935","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$\\mathcal 